I expect the question is not relevant to whether you will ascend or
not, as once you get to this point it is very likely that the rest of
the game will be comparatively easy (and if you die to something, it's
unlikely to be even an undirect consequence of your weapon enchantment!
*)

Personally I would go for excal + katana if you have a spare magic
lamp, sunsword + katana if you don't; searching and light will have a
greater effect on your game than weapon damage.  In this case I would
spend the 2 bEW on the primary artifact, and keep the third scroll
spare (unless your first bEW takes a weapon of known enchantment to
+4).

People who regularly use the 'Swandir may say that it is so useful
that it should always be your primary weapon once you have it and can
use it at basic.  I'm not sure.  Likewise, firebrand is very useful on
the planes, but you may not need the extra firepower.  If you're low
on maxHP or somehow don't have fire res yet, this would definitely be
a good choice, but otherwise I'd say you'll do fine without.

Just my 2 zm.

